			<div class="content" id="post-content-2852831">
									

<blockquote>
<p>Even <strong>more</strong> important: <em>The diagnosis of schizophrenia may have actually been completely wrong!</em></p>
</blockquote>
<p>So, this thing doesn't actually operate on whether or not the person is <em>actually</em> mentally ill, just whether or not someone has put in <em>writing</em> that they're mentally ill (or autistic, or whatnot)? The skip made me sick to my stomach before, this addition does not help my feelings right now.</p>
<p>I mean, great job? I'm pretty sure my reaction was what you were going for here! You really hit me in the gut there. But I'm not going back and reading this again.</p>

