														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2853041">
									

<p>Yeah, it doesn't care if you're actually suffering from mental illness (that's partly what I wanted to get across with Lindsey's method of gaining entrance). All it cares about is that someone, somewhere, at some point officially <em>decided</em> that you are mentally ill. And put it in writing.</p>
<p>Which is kind of the point, because &#8212; that's one of the fucked up things in psychiatry this thing represents.</p>
<p>I'm sorry that it made you sick to your stomach! It's kind of supposed to (obviously!), but I don't want to make people feel <em>too</em> much like crap (I was hoping the ending might alleviate some of that, but it's still pretty messed up stuff, I know). Thank you for the feedback!</p>

